<title>USA: Time Warner names J. Carter Bacot to board.</title>
<headline>Time Warner names J. Carter Bacot to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc said on Thursday it named J. Carter Bacot, the chairman and chief executive of Bank of New York Co Inc and chairman of its unit Bank of New York, to the Time Warner board of directors.</p>
<p>Bacot fills a seat designated for selection by Time Warner's vice chairman R.E. Turner when the merger of Time Warner and Turner Broadcasting System was consummated.</p>
<p>The company said Bacot joined Bank of New York in 1960 and was elected to his present position in 1982.</p>
</text>
